00:00:07,166 --> 00:00:07,966
Ah!

2
00:00:10,266 --> 00:00:17,600
Step by step, no hurry. Steady wins the race.

3
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,300
Don't you worry.

4
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,166
