9
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:41,733
Patience is a wisdom that grows through the years.

10
00:00:41,733 --> 00:00:46,366
Slow and steady, like a friendly turtle walk.

11
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:51,333
Take your time before you talk.

12
00:00:52,066 --> 00:00:56,766
Step by step, piece by piece,

13
00:00:57,266 --> 00:01:01,866
Watch the frustration softly cease.

14
