One by one, once more.

17
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,000
It takes a little time,

18
00:01:15,266 --> 00:01:17,533
But oh, what a sight

19
00:01:17,566 --> 00:01:22,800
When the whole picture fits just right!

20
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:30,666
Slow and steady, like a friendly turtle walk.

21
00:01:31,166 --> 00:01:35,700
Take your time before you talk.

